[Tips.カメラフレーム]
effect.name=Draws a camera frame-like shape.\n
PI=- `width`: Width in pixels\n- `height`: Height in pixels\n- `line_length`: Line length in pixels\n- `line_thickness`: Line thickness in pixels\n- `line_color`: Line color (`0xRRGGBB`)\n- `size_specifier`: Size mode (1 = margin, 2 = absolute)\n- `debug`: Debug mode\n

